{"sha": "557de96ad90404833dc92609bbf57f2f28db7fe780ad528d0c016c0c8173e105", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  \\draw[thin, gray!40] (-0.4,-0.4) grid (8.4,5.4);", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.6,0) -- (8.6,0);", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,-0.6) -- (0,5.6);", "  \\coordinate (A) at (1,1);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (3,2);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (7,4);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (A) -- (B)", "    node[midway, above left=-2pt, font=\\small] {$\\vect{AB}$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (A) -- (C)", "    node[pos=0.8, below right=-2pt, font=\\small] {$\\vect{AC} = 3\\vect{AB}$};", "  \\fill (A) circle (2pt) node[above left, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (B) circle (2pt) node[above left, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\fill (C) circle (2pt) node[above left, font=\\small] {$C$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 共线点：$\\vect{AC}$ 是 $\\vect{AB}$ 的数乘。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:1}", "利用 Chasles 关系化简：", "\\[", "\\vect{AB} + \\vect{BD}, \\qquad", "\\vect{KL} + \\vect{LM} + \\vect{MK}, \\qquad", "\\vect{AC} - \\vect{BC}, \\qquad", "\\vect{AB} + \\vect{CA}.", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:2}", "设 $A(2, 1)$、$B(5, 3)$、$C(-1, 4)$。求", "$\\vect{AB}$、$\\vect{BC}$、$\\vect{AC}$ 的坐标，并用坐标检验", "$\\vect{AB} + \\vect{BC} = \\vect{AC}$ 成立。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:3}", "设 $\\vec u\\,(2, -3)$、$\\vec v\\,(-1, 4)$。求", "$\\vec u + \\vec v$、$3\\vec u$、$2\\vec u - \\vec v$ 的坐标，并计算", "$\\norm{\\vec u}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:4}", "分别判断 $\\vec u$ 与 $\\vec v$ 是否共线：", "\\[", "\\text{(a) } \\vec u\\,(4, 6),\\ \\vec v\\,(6, 9);", "\\qquad", "\\text{(b) } \\vec u\\,(2, -5),\\ \\vec v\\,(-4, 10);", "\\qquad", "\\text{(c) } \\vec u\\,(3, 1),\\ \\vec v\\,(1, 3).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:5}", "设 $A(0, 2)$、$B(4, 0)$、$C(6, 3)$。求点", "$D$ 的坐标，使 $ABCD$ 为平行四边形，即", "$\\vect{AB} = \\vect{DC}$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:6}", "设 $A(-2, 1)$、$B(1, 3)$、$C(4, -1)$。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 求点 $M$ 的坐标，使", "        $\\vect{AM} = \\vect{AB} + \\vect{AC}$.", "  \\item 四边形 $ABMC$ 是什么图形？请说明理由。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:7}", "设 $A(1, -1)$、$B(4, 1)$、$C(10, 5)$。判断点 $A$、$B$、$C$", "是否共线？对 $A(0, 3)$、$B(2, 2)$、$C(8, -1)$ 作同样的判断。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:8}", "设 $A(1, 2)$、$B(5, 4)$、$C(6, 1)$、$D(2, -1)$。证明 $(AB)$ 与", "$(CD)$ 平行，再证明 $ABCD$ 为平行四边形。哪一个验证", "可推出另一个？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:9}", "设 $ABC$ 为三角形，点 $I$ 由", "$\\vect{AI} = \\frac23 \\vect{AB}$ 定义。取 $A(0,0)$、$B(6, 3)$、$C(2, 5)$", "（使计算简便）：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 求 $I$ 的坐标；", "  \\item 设点 $J$ 满足 $\\vect{CJ} = \\frac23\\vect{CB}$，求", "        $J$ 的坐标；", "  \\item 证明 $(IJ)$ 与 $(AC)$ 平行。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:vectors:10}", "设 $ABCD$ 为任意四边形，$I$、$J$、$K$、$L$ 分别为", "线段 $[AB]$、$[BC]$、$[CD]$、$[DA]$ 的中点。用坐标", "$A(x_A, y_A)$ 等表示，证明 $\\vect{IJ} = \\vect{LK}$，并由此得出", "\\emph{任意}四边形各边的中点构成", "平行四边形。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\section{问题：有向线段的代数}", "", "\\begin{problem}[{周末问题 --- Chasles 体操，", "两行重证重心，以及平衡力：", "向量究竟有什么用}]", "\\label{pb:g10:vectors:1}", "八年级已证明，三角形的三条中线交于各自", "长度的三分之二处 --- 其中藏着一个巧妙的平行四边形", "（见初中分册中的重心周末问题）。向量只需", "两行即可重证，三线共点随之免费得到。这正是", "这门新代数的用途：定理化为有向线段上的计算。", "本题训练运算（首先是 Chasles 关系），给出两行证明，", "并推广瓦里尼翁定理", "（\\cref{exo:g10:vectors:10}），最后回到向量诞生之处：", "力与速度。", ""]}